From: VyOS LS1046A build <noreply@vyos-ls1046a>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hwmon: ina2xx: fix INA234 scaling values for the 6.18 formula

The Mono Gateway DK populates 8x TI INA234 power monitors behind a
pca9545 i2c mux (buses 12/13, addr 0x40-0x43).

Upstream linux-6.18.44 (the kernel bumped from 6.18.38 by upstream
vyos-build rolling on 2026-08-13) now carries NATIVE "ti,ina234"
support — enum entry, per-chip config, i2c id table and of_match were
added upstream — but the upstream config block uses the parked 6.6-era
scaling values:

    shunt_div = 25, bus_voltage_lsb = 25600

With the 6.18 conversion ((regval >> bus_voltage_shift) *
bus_voltage_lsb, 12-bit ADC result in bits[15:4]) that reads the bus
voltage 16x too high. The pre-6.18.44 OOT patch (this file's previous
incarnation) added the full ina234 support and conflicted with the
native code ("Reversed (or previously applied) patch detected" — the
enum/config/of_match hunks all already exist).

The correct 6.18 values are shift=4 with lsb=1600 uV (1.6 mV
effective); power coefficient 32 and has_alerts already match upstream.
This patch now only corrects the two wrong values in the native block
(keep calibration_value=2048, config_default=INA226_CONFIG_DEFAULT).

Signed-off-by: VyOS LS1046A build <noreply@vyos-ls1046a>
---
 drivers/hwmon/ina2xx.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/hwmon/ina2xx.c b/drivers/hwmon/ina2xx.c
index 9c2dc9c..153eec0 100644
--- a/drivers/hwmon/ina2xx.c
+++ b/drivers/hwmon/ina2xx.c
@@ -203,10 +203,10 @@ static const struct ina2xx_config ina2xx_config[] = {
 	[ina234] = {
 		.config_default = INA226_CONFIG_DEFAULT,
 		.calibration_value = 2048,
-		.shunt_div = 25, /* 2.5 µV/LSB raw ADC reading from INA2XX_SHUNT_VOLTAGE */
+		.shunt_div = 400, /* 4 µV/LSB raw ADC reading from INA2XX_SHUNT_VOLTAGE */
 		.shunt_voltage_shift = 4,
 		.bus_voltage_shift = 4,
-		.bus_voltage_lsb = 25600,
+		.bus_voltage_lsb = 1600,
 		.power_lsb_factor = 32,
 		.has_alerts = true,
 		.has_ishunt = false,
-- 
2.39.5
